    "detailed_description": "The sequel for Idle Dice is here!<br />\r\nIdle Dice 2 expands on the gameplay of its predecessor and adds more things: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMORE DICE<br />\r\nUp to 25 dice to upgrade independently<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMORE CARDS<br />\r\nThe basic set of cards is too boring for you? Idle Dice 2 features cards that don't exist in the real world. Why limit yourself to 13 cards if you could draw the whole alphabet?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCREATE YOUR DECK<br />\r\nYou can choose which card to add to your deck to master various challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFAIR<br />\r\nLike all my games, watching ads is entirely optional and the game is balanced to play without the need to spend money to progress.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand most importantly:<br />\r\nDARK MODE<br />\r\nThe most requested feature for Idle Dice 1 is finally here!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is still being developed and more content will get added. Be part of the development by joining the discord server and give feedback.",
    "about_the_game": "The sequel for Idle Dice is here!<br />\r\nIdle Dice 2 expands on the gameplay of its predecessor and adds more things: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMORE DICE<br />\r\nUp to 25 dice to upgrade independently<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMORE CARDS<br />\r\nThe basic set of cards is too boring for you? Idle Dice 2 features cards that don't exist in the real world. Why limit yourself to 13 cards if you could draw the whole alphabet?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCREATE YOUR DECK<br />\r\nYou can choose which card to add to your deck to master various challenges.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFAIR<br />\r\nLike all my games, watching ads is entirely optional and the game is balanced to play without the need to spend money to progress.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nand most importantly:<br />\r\nDARK MODE<br />\r\nThe most requested feature for Idle Dice 1 is finally here!!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is still being developed and more content will get added. Be part of the development by joining the discord server and give feedback.",
